---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title={`Now — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="What Andrew Dobrow is working on and thinking about right now." /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <header class="page-heading">
        <h1>Now</h1>
        <p>What I'm focused on lately, outside of the usual day-to-day. <span class="updated">Updated October 19, 2026.</span></p>
      </header>
      <article class="prose now-content">
        <p>I've always got several ideas competing for my attention. These are the ones getting most of it right now.</p>

        <h2>Currently building</h2>
        <p><strong><a href="https://treasurecoast.today/">Treasure Coast Today</a></strong> — The local news site I started in June 2026. Most days involve some combination of editorial work, improving the technology behind it, iterating on bugs, and finding new ways to reach readers and support the business.</p>
        <p><strong>The Treasure Coast Today iPhone app</strong> — Making local news easier to read and discover on a phone, with a better native experience. Currently waiting on Apple approval.</p>

        <h2>Currently focused on</h2>
        <p>Building multiple revenue streams for Treasure Coast Today. Actively reaching out to local businesses for sponsored partnerships.</p>

        <h2>Outside the browser</h2>
        <p>I started reading through Erik Rostad's <a href="https://books.booksoftitans.com/">Books of Titans.</a> </p>

        <h2>Reading</h2>
        <p><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/en/book/show/21853621-the-nightingale">The Nightingale</a> by Kristin Hannah</p>
	<p><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/33449.The_22_Immutable_Laws_of_Marketing">The 22 Immutable Laws of Marketing</a> by Al Ries and Jack Trout</p>

        <p class="now-explainer">This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">/now page</a>: a simple, periodically updated answer to “what are you up to these days?”</p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
<style>
.updated { white-space: nowrap; color: #87918b; font-size: .84rem; }
.now-content strong { font-weight: 700; }
.now-explainer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 40px !important; padding-top: 20px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .87rem; }
</style>
